**Hag** | Unaligned Power | Limited
__Basics__
The Hag must live win with a solo team. During the night, the Hag may choose to specialize.
__Details__
The Hag wins if they survive until the end of the game and if a solo team wins the game.
If a Solo player uses a power on the Hag, the Hag learns their identity. If they attempt to kill the Hag, the attack fails.
During the night, the Hag may choose to become either a Vicious, Cautious or Prophetic Hag, gaining a power they will be able to use each night for the rest of the game.
If the last solo role dies, the Hag turns into a solo role, becoming a bitter hag.

